{"version":1,"content":"<p>《女神配對計劃2》本周日（29日）播出的一集，一眾女神將各見邀請一位親友幫眼，當中陳若思（Amber）就出動「索爆」表姐「見家長」把關。</p><p>在流出的花絮照片中，身穿白色長裙的她仙氣十足，而表姐亦長髮披肩，相當省鏡，難怪有網民問：「幾時出道？</p><p>」&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:23:55.100726+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:15.010806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:15.010806+00:00","content_hash":"81bda1f0a37a4c86d6bc47c28ceb3e23d045a6ba14630d09eb9285b117182d9b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}